      "response": {
        "answer": "Several schemes are available for girl students. First, the Pragati Scholarship Scheme For Girl Students (Technical Degree) supports female students pursuing a technical degree at an AICTE-approved institution by applying online through the National Scholarship Portal (NSP). Second, the Pragati Scholarship Scheme For Girl Students (Technical Diploma) assists female students pursuing a technical diploma at an AICTE-approved institution, with applications also submitted online via the National Scholarship Portal (NSP). Finally, the Post Graduate Indira Gandhi Scholarship For Single Girl Child is available for single girl children admitted to a regular, full-time non-professional Master's degree course; eligible candidates apply online through the National Scholarship Portal after a notice is published on the UGC website.",
